{"id":"431841","name":"虾皮蒸蛋","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"","cover":"images/431841/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"两个"},{"name":"虾皮","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"酱油","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"香油","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"凉开水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好鸡蛋.凉开水，凉开水和鸡蛋液一样多。","img":"images/431841/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"虾皮清洗干净。","img":"images/431841/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"去掉杂质。","img":"images/431841/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋液搅拌均匀，到入玻璃碗内。","img":"images/431841/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"撒上虾皮。","img":"images/431841/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上保鲜膜，用牙签扎几个洞。","img":"images/431841/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"冷水上锅烧开，蒸10分钟。","img":"images/431841/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入生抽。","img":"images/431841/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入香油。","img":"images/431841/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"滑嫩，鲜香。","img":"images/431841/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}